cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this study, please cite the repository and the study version."
title: "GraphAmbiCardio: a provenance-first knowledge graph of environmental exposures, molecular mechanisms, cardiogenesis and congenital heart defects"
version: 0.4.0
date-released: 2026-11-01
license: MIT
type: software
abstract: >-
  Computational study integrating structured literature searches, curated
  biological databases, SINASC/SIH data from Campos dos Goytacazes (RJ, Brazil)
  and ERA5-Land climate into a provenance-first knowledge graph of congenital
  heart defects.
keywords:
  - congenital heart defects
  - environmental exposure
  - knowledge graph
  - cardiogenesis
  - evidence grading
  - Brazil
